  "description": "Inspired by the Boardwalk, the Lil'Bolt is KID-FIT friendly, ready for action and built to last. You can pass this from sibling to sibling or put it next to the Boardwalk as part of your rental fleet. The scaled down KID-FIT cranks, pedals, handlebar, and saddle are perfect for smaller riders.\nLightweight 6061 aluminum frame\nSingle-speed drivetrain\nShimano coaster brake\nKID-FIT alloy crankset with sealed cartridge bottom bracket and KMC RustBuster chain\nAlloy rims with stainless steel spokes\n20\" x 2.125\" semi-slick tires\nKID-FIT steel handlebar with inner foam protection and rubber grips\nKID-FIT coil spring cruiser saddle\nSteel chain guard\nAlloy kickstand",
